{"id":"vod_bf_26680","vodId":"26680","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"奇幻贵公子","name_cn":"奇幻贵公子","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第24集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-27/16e1ece3ae1e077aaab721c151a30d76.jpg"},"summary":"谷山麻衣（名冢佳织 配音）是个有预知和感应能力的高一女生，机遇巧合之下认识了长相英俊、颇为自恋的涉谷一也（泰勇气 配音），原来他是个专业的狩灵师，还是专门调查灵异事件事务所的所长，他身边有个叫林兴徐的助手。麻衣所在的学校出现了谣传，说旧校舍被灵所诅咒。涉谷一也受到校长委托，来到学校调查。同时被叫来的，还有巫女松崎绫子、和尚滝川法生、驱魔者约翰·布朗和灵媒师原真砂子。一行人在展开调查之时，发生了种种事故，这究竟是何种力量在作祟？　　事件解决后，涉谷一也邀请麻衣加入他的涉谷心灵研究所（即SPR）打工。SPR接受各种委托，对各类灵异事件展开调查。麻衣和涉谷他们不仅仅用自身超能力解决问题，而且还会用现代科学解释。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 20:18:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qihuanguigongzi/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4